      "content": "thanks. the traditionalist one is okay but feels a little bit too generic/vague. can you make him sound more specific about *why* he thinks tradition matters? like give him some actual substance so he sounds truly wise and not just like he's reading a Hallmark card. \n\nand for the progressive, can you make them sound even more urgent? maybe lean into the idea that they aren't just angry, but that they've seen something so wrong they can't stay quiet anymore.",
